    "dcterms:alternative": [
        {
            "@value": "高くなっている値段を抑えるのに協力するわ　皆さん、価格を抑えておくための7案を実行しましょう",
            "is_public": true,
            "property_id": 17,
            "property_label": "Alternative Title",
            "type": "literal"
        }
    ],
    "dcterms:description": [
        {
            "@value": "I'm out to lick runaway prices / Let's all follow the 7-key plan to hold prices down / 1. Buy and hold war bonds / 2. Pay willingly our share of taxes / 3. Provide adequate life insurance and savings for our future / 4. Reduce our debts as much as possible / 5. Buy only what we need and make what we have last longer / 6. Follow ration rules and price ceilings / 7. Cooperate with our government’s wage stabilization program",
            "is_public": true,
            "property_id": 4,
            "property_label": "Description",
            "type": "literal"
        },
        {
            "@value": "価格管理局の後身として設けられた経済安定局は、戦時中のインフレ昂進を抑制することがその重要な役割であった。エプロンを付けたエリザベス・テイラー風の女性が拳をにぎっている絵。",
            "is_public": true,
            "property_id": 4,
            "property_label": "Description",
            "type": "literal"
        }
    ],
